  "events": [
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Build a short introduction and make a first drink request. Listen to each new expression before trying it. During thinking pauses, speak aloud or answer silently. The following voice gives a model. Begin with hello.",
      "text_sha256": "f59aa6461eba9ce6c066a534d8cafb5e8dce5ff0db8e8a37a24ee31f286dd02f",
      "audio_sha256": "302725e3fae045a084a18672d8e3972f5dc3e84d5073561b53578b2068728660",
      "cacheFile": "47de05eca46da071dc0c2628ec4b145355c9abecc3c717bb294c0cca5b0260ed.wav",
      "durationS": 15.025
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo.",
      "text_sha256": "a7bc973835929ba2ff64f6b9b0a346e188c2753407c6177115edf2bee58d0909",
      "audio_sha256": "a719612251a741b0c11516754b36fc271efa838938dd99872832d0175fb9b202",
      "cacheFile": "21ed1468d59f4ebf23e0f67348ec9c7d69d0c0b9a99c03bb758a39820a3d80e7.wav",
      "durationS": 0.592
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Picture someone looking up as you arrive. During the pause, say hello from memory. If nothing comes, listen to the model and try again. You only need a greeting, with no name or extra sentence.",
      "text_sha256": "58a6053f24cd1b64e51588425123f5214d2c2f3c6265e91a7791ee16cf5506a2",
      "audio_sha256": "08913a6bef129a78c7a21248200694f54b868cc111731a7f0dbd1067ce8b3723",
      "cacheFile": "a6effed9b8698e846dde022aaa67a5327f318c5b53805ecfe1bd5cf8d3f2e8e4.wav",
      "durationS": 13.075
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo.",
      "text_sha256": "a7bc973835929ba2ff64f6b9b0a346e188c2753407c6177115edf2bee58d0909",
      "audio_sha256": "a719612251a741b0c11516754b36fc271efa838938dd99872832d0175fb9b202",
      "cacheFile": "21ed1468d59f4ebf23e0f67348ec9c7d69d0c0b9a99c03bb758a39820a3d80e7.wav",
      "durationS": 0.592
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "The next expression tells someone what you are called, followed by the name. Treat its opening as one useful block and put your own name after it. Our first example speaker is Anna; listen to the full introduction.",
      "text_sha256": "afb20ee9f7ba868e1aacbc8f179f31c4dd4499d50d65dc8b5a2152f55f3ff8cd",
      "audio_sha256": "82ff0e10c1f44c5c35a3c2c0029408eac5ce4e92819cc475e4c39850cba07f03",
      "cacheFile": "76a2cc8c2c607f18d53fe0362e4e938d22cf298b2675f782d243870420a67a4b.wav",
      "durationS": 14.225
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "8018f2f68b239b9a02a8b2b9613cbf2977a478d0786afc872de48115beb8e9a3",
      "audio_sha256": "e41fff9de843ff16bd9435087f37f29ac6ee38b0002d57d4a601937643332543",
      "cacheFile": "1c01d5ccbb92c83540f31918caffc28814d531333b6c609eaebc4e5331890128.wav",
      "durationS": 0.987
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Imagine that you are Anna. Tell a new acquaintance your name using the expression you just heard. Keep the opening together and finish with the name. Take your time; matching the recording speed is not the goal.",
      "text_sha256": "df8e6f917ef59cd505373cf9f1c2918883f579af8d40c4b71e502587b0d8d96f",
      "audio_sha256": "78b947a4805e54b220cca35009b9a62787ca7caa6ea400e0348f491e1cc69d6a",
      "cacheFile": "eee069192f915bac6585ad14993fdc2538310094876b8735560f01b6e3b4e4ea.wav",
      "durationS": 13.725
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "8018f2f68b239b9a02a8b2b9613cbf2977a478d0786afc872de48115beb8e9a3",
      "audio_sha256": "e41fff9de843ff16bd9435087f37f29ac6ee38b0002d57d4a601937643332543",
      "cacheFile": "1c01d5ccbb92c83540f31918caffc28814d531333b6c609eaebc4e5331890128.wav",
      "durationS": 0.987
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "The same opening can introduce another person when that person is speaking. Listen to a second example name. The name changes while the introduction before it stays the same. You are learning a reusable pattern.",
      "text_sha256": "cc46d4833a7199a75c478357874c13c26de72b1c258fa4fb4557eaea09b64fcb",
      "audio_sha256": "42e5185ca70d36deb6f002888174c5dfc5c0491138d70c6bd011ec6dfe9be5c3",
      "cacheFile": "0305242e4ebf918a779b3c1cabad5db0e66085e5c0fca72a5a4bb0b42ceda16f.wav",
      "durationS": 14.6
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich heiße Lukas.",
      "text_sha256": "b1ded3e8f38ba4a7e071d2674d5169ded7fe2e2ed639f87bd058ff8504f56d18",
      "audio_sha256": "19b9b05e6a380efaa1d59fc2a48d863538dd24dcba404cbfd9f5f21c7bce179d",
      "cacheFile": "d75abfbc25f51628a2c619fc12a70f087b0e195cdb99345a776ceb9280a70fac.wav",
      "durationS": 1.161
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Take the role of the second speaker. Introduce yourself with that name, keeping the same opening from the first introduction. Separate the fixed block from the replaceable name in your mind, then combine them.",
      "text_sha256": "785f5268adf6d44bdf98a3d50c637e0ca12e8125f20929ccba623d8fd6e250c9",
      "audio_sha256": "13bc02905b9cb00115955d05b030c26645b03f32ab37c49a457e0645df2e9911",
      "cacheFile": "18ba83a94767dd13c4d6dab4b5d70bf8842a186c18fb52f3a95eb93b555f1f9f.wav",
      "durationS": 13.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich heiße Lukas.",
      "text_sha256": "b1ded3e8f38ba4a7e071d2674d5169ded7fe2e2ed639f87bd058ff8504f56d18",
      "audio_sha256": "19b9b05e6a380efaa1d59fc2a48d863538dd24dcba404cbfd9f5f21c7bce179d",
      "cacheFile": "d75abfbc25f51628a2c619fc12a70f087b0e195cdb99345a776ceb9280a70fac.wav",
      "durationS": 1.161
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Switch back to Anna and use the name introduction again. This change of speaker helps you choose the name deliberately. If you used the previous name automatically, rebuild the introduction with the first name.",
      "text_sha256": "d108e5b99fa419f4c115244afe9438f8ef3ff5c80817115be4ee6e60354f9645",
      "audio_sha256": "e8cdf3f0a5b4c37b10f3c771b57175e77db59e6b4234dddf0324a8f53ee54eef",
      "cacheFile": "55ab8c6e589393a7ad08d9e80100af4e96e04d290916d60fe03890d51c11d762.wav",
      "durationS": 13.875
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "8018f2f68b239b9a02a8b2b9613cbf2977a478d0786afc872de48115beb8e9a3",
      "audio_sha256": "e41fff9de843ff16bd9435087f37f29ac6ee38b0002d57d4a601937643332543",
      "cacheFile": "1c01d5ccbb92c83540f31918caffc28814d531333b6c609eaebc4e5331890128.wav",
      "durationS": 0.987
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "The next expression means I am, followed by the name. It includes an explicit word for I. Keep those opening words together for now; you are learning a second useful introduction rather than a whole table of verb forms.",
      "text_sha256": "80e7f4dc6c14736f060b647e49c3dde98f64736203e51ce3ccb7a8fd90057c4f",
      "audio_sha256": "8b85adef62b8161ea3fba59eae9f9449bf929d2b519b85dead626b024da14fb0",
      "cacheFile": "9c14006da6cb88782b6798c171bf8ea35fc5ad3ceba15fa85726b7bf5eacee09.wav",
      "durationS": 15.15
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich bin Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "5fd43bb8d13d44548278471f2b38e57de1915d3877589ed20b3c4a2d7aaf75d4",
      "audio_sha256": "cdcec5ab4f6d6b878de3a0696dd0e58ed9c2d8d867a483aed3df6afebea5dbfb",
      "cacheFile": "f895f0a3205998f70d63b980654ef6ad2e766f481fc8e612490e151ac50b427f.wav",
      "durationS": 0.848
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Express I am Anna, using the newer block rather than the expression that tells someone your name. Keep your answer short. After the pause, compare your opening with the model to check which pattern you chose.",
      "text_sha256": "408e8f15047260257ed0256f8f0010f171f80c52e8b0b841d671c1c528d2e2d5",
      "audio_sha256": "3b3469d3151d2d321955a5b8f6ccbfbd53d8b864a8c0583582298fcf7514fb91",
      "cacheFile": "6c7fd2381bb41905bb14402788311bd062263c82b1ba2f50b0812c26e2074bbf.wav",
      "durationS": 13.125
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich bin Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "5fd43bb8d13d44548278471f2b38e57de1915d3877589ed20b3c4a2d7aaf75d4",
      "audio_sha256": "cdcec5ab4f6d6b878de3a0696dd0e58ed9c2d8d867a483aed3df6afebea5dbfb",
      "cacheFile": "f895f0a3205998f70d63b980654ef6ad2e766f481fc8e612490e151ac50b427f.wav",
      "durationS": 0.848
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Use the I am pattern with the second name you heard. You know both pieces, but this combination is new. Keep the opening and replace only the name. Listen afterward to check the combination.",
      "text_sha256": "dd4bc621cf4276f41d4a0e6f5e6eabe2783a1a392351b7d5dd2b3678eeafa579",
      "audio_sha256": "9a630dfed12a8fce6ddb23d138d742bdbdba50c618ca07c3946a0ba2c6fdcf2b",
      "cacheFile": "c5c24f24cc41dbf38b63daee7ac6f34869389e6286e9e17b31ad0be3f600f669.wav",
      "durationS": 12.95
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich bin Lukas.",
      "text_sha256": "74a9ae8877569c6413d3e30088a06114e11ff40cd5e7a8845ce07177595fd3cb",
      "audio_sha256": "341802170794b3865645f30eec28536cd7cc0ceb539d5781484b175ee1b549f3",
      "cacheFile": "d37bef928ce8a6e310de071561eff3bfd21cb3637f1a2428c46d11fe8b86888a.wav",
      "durationS": 0.882
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "A greeting and introduction can sit together as two short sentences. Listen to hello followed by the first name introduction. No special joining word is needed; leave a small natural break between the two pieces.",
      "text_sha256": "78d5cc1e5a377942f8231ec9e78ea472160bd2d38c318b91f4c503f7ac8c1883",
      "audio_sha256": "213e045e0f51d17e8ac5dbf6f666c104b524fe531ced674a3659da47f5488dfe",
      "cacheFile": "3173ff73636ca35b78ad3ea026e1d2189f5b1c7ca3d0e9e8ce6a3ac025fa5722.wav",
      "durationS": 14.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo. Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "33e65ec3eb030173fc0bc2e021928f419e45a63f43282e5dd13de39571086b48",
      "audio_sha256": "e36faeb7974355654b4919adcf49d834a0ed0849f37f4c0d292d45eef374b7d1",
      "cacheFile": "f11812d40811a6ed3312959936583db83366438618ccf712acc4b8147bae243a.wav",
      "durationS": 1.637
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Imagine arriving at a small group. Greet them, then introduce yourself as Anna using the name expression. Retrieve the greeting first, then the introduction. You can pause between them and still communicate clearly.",
      "text_sha256": "f17bfeb4daf97a6e57ed949c82c469c68ce70f3a9edf1abb8ac86669ec1e4463",
      "audio_sha256": "0288dbc2b93601b037ed3921ee3a9f0897a357ec9af7c3e71e8d3932f3da8d92",
      "cacheFile": "b88c77f239c6d9d89405d1e28c44acf3438e8fc3a5392b77a90ef2c4346711bb.wav",
      "durationS": 14.3
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo. Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "33e65ec3eb030173fc0bc2e021928f419e45a63f43282e5dd13de39571086b48",
      "audio_sha256": "e36faeb7974355654b4919adcf49d834a0ed0849f37f4c0d292d45eef374b7d1",
      "cacheFile": "f11812d40811a6ed3312959936583db83366438618ccf712acc4b8147bae243a.wav",
      "durationS": 1.637
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "For this request, the model uses the object form of the small word meaning a. Learn the entire request as a block. Later lessons can explain the case system; here you need a reliable expression for ordering.",
      "text_sha256": "4527ea7b9a8fc3a8ccc1d9d566c815f2f08489ba41aacad83ed1189bdf48d1ed",
      "audio_sha256": "ae9522617d7c3d514b77c6fd4f0e61e366d514ad6e6d662069057a5719ae137d",
      "cacheFile": "c56352be1b6ca847b19b2d62acf39db011f0a6ba296d0c6323c377b7c04f2051.wav",
      "durationS": 14.525
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Einen Kaffee.",
      "text_sha256": "e78b03314091198db697b24b293139c6c58a2649f52b5fa4979e8b66de3843e8",
      "audio_sha256": "d26223d43c945d29d4af6eb9acd577ce08b6d1e63072496c6c64f1cea8f3c1a5",
      "cacheFile": "bd8720143978e587c6e89e9aff8e2272d8c6bd30ba8afc1c6eecfe60afabdb42.wav",
      "durationS": 0.755
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Imagine standing at a drinks counter. Ask for a coffee using the block you just heard. We will add please shortly; first remember the drink together with its small word, rather than the drink alone.",
      "text_sha256": "2b1b477061d4be64f3ea0e0180453a43ae4fc5c3abf9fc234e56abf70aefc7f9",
      "audio_sha256": "e9fa0d4daa479a8c37c7aa282b5927816c082d390d32d32ff7e0a06a21f12385",
      "cacheFile": "e5e7920745423f6053a6e5523ed74b60c8452650453ac4d470fef0db336f953b.wav",
      "durationS": 13.0
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Einen Kaffee.",
      "text_sha256": "e78b03314091198db697b24b293139c6c58a2649f52b5fa4979e8b66de3843e8",
      "audio_sha256": "d26223d43c945d29d4af6eb9acd577ce08b6d1e63072496c6c64f1cea8f3c1a5",
      "cacheFile": "bd8720143978e587c6e89e9aff8e2272d8c6bd30ba8afc1c6eecfe60afabdb42.wav",
      "durationS": 0.755
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Listen to the expression meaning please. Here it will come after the drink. First hear it alone so you can recognize it independently; the next example will attach it to the coffee request.",
      "text_sha256": "f4609ed70f84325941377c63c4bf61c6a3dffb9e99a4e7f97fb398985dc14744",
      "audio_sha256": "61ff0e88796f5464f0dd0a6604d30c25994e15754eeb47f7283d958b410d43fc",
      "cacheFile": "f8341ea200170a1b07b030f5abf0cdfe6aa384e73a1691b77f5551289bee2f36.wav",
      "durationS": 12.325
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Bitte.",
      "text_sha256": "0a48ee3eb8603502e959a6bd4c67e7d45fcb63136261db721a6d2a4afa12daa5",
      "audio_sha256": "aec6a1cc0d952db7733ac979f24b735270398ecfd4627121aab665345836b561",
      "cacheFile": "c6ab533cb61244218e5e6e3b5993a855cf7bbe1d457b4ba9056f5e2165b4ef60.wav",
      "durationS": 0.522
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Now hear a fuller polite request: I would like a coffee, please. The new opening means I would like. Learn it as one block before the coffee request you know. Listen first; you will try it next.",
      "text_sha256": "ce7905a07f94a9935a378bdb530239dd12a4e74c823258ff01729ce0e291e5b7",
      "audio_sha256": "9c6d078cd4715c83737a3611aa2ea7225437abf9b6e3ad7b58b86367bfa1a115",
