    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Imagine meeting someone away from the counter. Say hello and introduce yourself as Anna with the name expression. Returning to an earlier pattern after another topic lets you retrieve it without copying the previous model.",
      "text_sha256": "50accacd623b51e6d000b706a44c6d38a9a9cf61d820765c08753e8bfd322708",
      "audio_sha256": "e5c970977f7d2bb5701b6ff87731d3a328e99d6e0d8990e157f5f7cc6157582d",
      "cacheFile": "e8baf0677295e7f3e969e13818d79eb6e4078c92f6cc870b3049f3c1812a1e11.wav",
      "durationS": 14.825
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo. Ich heiße Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "33e65ec3eb030173fc0bc2e021928f419e45a63f43282e5dd13de39571086b48",
      "audio_sha256": "e36faeb7974355654b4919adcf49d834a0ed0849f37f4c0d292d45eef374b7d1",
      "cacheFile": "f11812d40811a6ed3312959936583db83366438618ccf712acc4b8147bae243a.wav",
      "durationS": 1.637
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Say I am Anna with the second identity expression. Compare it with the name expression from the previous turn. They share a purpose, but have different openings. Choose the requested opening during the pause.",
      "text_sha256": "7153b60fc67b1bd724ded7938a4aff8367da7e055aafad8dcf4b707429e2d9ce",
      "audio_sha256": "4aa947caf14dd15fc2e397fff75ff233bee2340a97d6b0fd481a3acfd00dd84e",
      "cacheFile": "e764d7d80982873135f1eb3dc8ee52739b8b5db27786fc39b0e7020a044b4189.wav",
      "durationS": 13.725
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich bin Anna.",
      "text_sha256": "5fd43bb8d13d44548278471f2b38e57de1915d3877589ed20b3c4a2d7aaf75d4",
      "audio_sha256": "cdcec5ab4f6d6b878de3a0696dd0e58ed9c2d8d867a483aed3df6afebea5dbfb",
      "cacheFile": "f895f0a3205998f70d63b980654ef6ad2e766f481fc8e612490e151ac50b427f.wav",
      "durationS": 0.848
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Finally, say I would like a tea, please. After the model, try the same full request with coffee independently. Replay sections that need practice; a slow successful retrieval is useful progress toward speaking without an immediate example.",
      "text_sha256": "90d407fa47c97d5656f02304b70b9213b7c549587518a3168979d0f69fbaac6f",
      "audio_sha256": "0ed45a6ab72f5c353077c8c1d669d5795a31cc0ce4c1e8e61c81e43f91522ea3",
      "cacheFile": "88ce6f57cd72d50d1c04060c10cfd0cb95d0b1704e724e6ad356bfe1fa8d5b05.wav",
      "durationS": 16.7
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Ich möchte einen Tee, bitte.",
      "text_sha256": "2235aa4b3a786b82d7701f0961f3c5320770146ee9354634414b3d3f5ce3affe",
      "audio_sha256": "1359014a9dcf4c0715d335ff4cba6bdae27a1e0dacf90cbe107b59186829b332",
      "cacheFile": "207cfd363dd91a6f75cfd1454012db23992981d1cbfc3e75dd4fa19ad837ba00.wav",
      "durationS": 1.474
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Let's add numbers. One is eins. Two is zwei. Three is drei. Four is vier. Five is fünf. Listen: eins, zwei, drei, vier, fünf. Zwei sounds like the English word two. Drei sounds like the English word three. Vier sounds like four. German kept the Latin echoes, just like English did.",
      "text_sha256": "b836e3e4e026266e33b0106cf0fb8952a199f3d4ac51df98a5de9c9c878e07a4",
      "audio_sha256": "336f029ce8436b2cb755bbba7f572ab4deabc8478cf8192e2c543ee1f04b9654",
      "cacheFile": "2d49a2202b5400cdbbdab79df4b07b8acf726e7ebcf42d0da0baf0cea67ce562.wav",
      "durationS": 21.475
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Eins, zwei, drei, vier, fünf.",
      "text_sha256": "5bf8779104a895a6a517751e031da77f60826a41a556935d84a146f20eed124c",
      "audio_sha256": "0d4f5d07a413227dfb1dfb974143de4a2c188c7a0eb2389908a02c213222fa10",
      "cacheFile": "b09acdc5f16543faa1e158e087bb0ed03e9085ee3fe13a68135feef5672ff806.wav",
      "durationS": 2.926
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Think. You want to say two coffees. Coffee is der Kaffee. Two is zwei. Build it: zwei Kaffees. Three teas: drei Tees. The number doesn't change, only the noun. Same logic as every other language in this lesson.",
      "text_sha256": "b258cba0a79531d17f516204dcd802668659cb2f869ebd03985e5edbb9b075af",
      "audio_sha256": "1fee9a5b1c05f1e1eae2d7327092350fed607e1700b4c60c110ebff736249364",
      "cacheFile": "d587a1de4c12c1f24a946093857fa47acdfd4aa86be3c7efb59e8f2406e21cb4.wav",
      "durationS": 15.475
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Zwei Kaffees. / Drei Tees.",
      "text_sha256": "2ddfc6fe7234381143f22d0dc610fb0f0cdd41f66551079df046bfa630bca0de",
      "audio_sha256": "fc644bcfc7660a7905221c85e625c4af0543a720cdb2adfb1ae4180da9284a95",
      "cacheFile": "7265b97fbda29e0b45e1c50702dbd8a796770fbee4ca929671db9c3db9dad863.wav",
      "durationS": 1.788
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Now time. Wie spät ist es? means what time is it — literally how late is it. The answer uses Uhr, which means o'clock. Es ist drei Uhr means it is three o'clock. One o'clock: Es ist ein Uhr. Two: Es ist zwei Uhr. The number stays the same, Uhr follows.",
      "text_sha256": "7c8dbbc2efa9702baa2db8df923b80848beff011dfce6032df5ce65e02d7a7b4",
      "audio_sha256": "cc774ab2d31e74f255d66a15d180d64982f1cfd4bcab5585c8b835e56d1e0e4a",
      "cacheFile": "6f6b017d215b3a0b0d4382e15dbf90a1f9d22e5056bfb14db26dc24846f17c0b.wav",
      "durationS": 19.025
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Wie spät ist es? Es ist drei Uhr.",
      "text_sha256": "bc4e764223d73672c01539f5ab9f9f5935bbb2535757f37f686e167a9f5a784d",
      "audio_sha256": "ba21d6fc6cf6cf9783400e307f98df6f1f0fec7ed20df31ad0c8c77db3a04afe",
      "cacheFile": "81a83c9260facdbbdc37def464e2916538c911cdebf73bc0a7c5b9fa859b6570.wav",
      "durationS": 2.043
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Think. You have a meeting at four. Es ist vier Uhr. Your friend asks when. Es ist vier Uhr, you say. Simple and regular — no singular trick like Spanish or Portuguese. German time is straightforward.",
      "text_sha256": "5a23688b039f667029f44411f1fceb248db0c9057c27dd1b030476283e9ee364",
      "audio_sha256": "e2eccab7e6cc38128f320eb1e0fc7a7642eef34d4c04b418018dd94328d736ce",
      "cacheFile": "7bf60664f4618416fe57dd377e2b87c2f531ac2b41936fdff546b052f06afd8b.wav",
      "durationS": 14.55
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Es ist ein Uhr. / Es ist vier Uhr.",
      "text_sha256": "d2dd99c9e7aae2e869e898999744ab93d08cce48a03a456b0bea23271265981e",
      "audio_sha256": "170b629bbc02336e03613a10692a7eee874bfd6ca399a6c183f50d2c2364b618",
      "cacheFile": "4f367bb3fa5cfa6e4f5f98ac909b124da01c6e281c7a1699c570577cc6a3a1fb.wav",
      "durationS": 1.985
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Let's stack everything. You walk into a restaurant at three o'clock. Hallo. Ich hätte gern einen Kaffee, bitte. — I would like a coffee, please. Es ist drei Uhr. You sit down. Ich hätte gern einen Kaffee und ein Stück Kuchen. — I would like a coffee and a piece of cake. Vier Euro. Danke. You used greetings, politeness, numbers, and time in one real transaction.",
      "text_sha256": "c656b644ce3f13830fd8ee1624afebbff0810b3a642b99f960709526ce84e13f",
      "audio_sha256": "19abbc382d8524b34984a77a693b244e119498b5b55051f674a2a980967eea73",
      "cacheFile": "47652a5bbd31ef59e32c138ab2a395b30e0ad8a5e6de1d4d1066c9446b711c96.wav",
      "durationS": 24.275
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "de",
      "voice": "de_DE-thorsten-medium",
      "text": "Hallo. Ich hätte gern einen Kaffee, bitte.",
      "text_sha256": "a7496bf7d15c2d9010739fb6c2bbb629d78c73d0871479344da7424c8e171ef0",
      "audio_sha256": "5f52b6c1f2e723472b492e3de260800e3e3218113fc499195b262486bfb6c43f",
      "cacheFile": "e3fd604294edcc290b4ad323f25a6ac29d3b065612647b556e0a1bc16dbe5a35.wav",
      "durationS": 2.624
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "text": "Let's do the full exchange. Hallo, guten Tag. Ich hätte gern einen Kaffee, bitte. Sonst noch etwas? Nein, danke. Vier Euro. Tschüss. Guten Tag means good day. Sonst noch etwas means anything else. Tschüss means bye. You just had a complete restaurant conversation using blocks from the entire lesson.",
      "text_sha256": "c7a2b10ca6555cb4907a46842777b4fb82d621c201bdd70d3ee4fbcbe848b6d3",
      "audio_sha256": "5f3d45a7b49853c3bee226672040017c7b56b3134c50a8df6acfb22f68f9630b",
      "cacheFile": "2bae7adb986eea64f43832e01cadea07d0a5602c069f36de2fee26d83384ba9e.wav",
      "durationS": 21.575
    },
